notes.content:
This update features lots of minor fixes and improvements, such as:

- Added texts on intro cutscenes;
- Added the option to turn on/off Screenshake;
- Explosive Damage Upgrade fixed;
- Explosives throw height adjustments;
- Fixed a rare issue when starting new profiles;
- Other small fixes and improvements;

Small update:

- Corrected a small bug related to player collisions;
- Corrected a rare bug when transitioning between levels.
